    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers: our model options include a Sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, which does not rely on non-European suppliers. a Sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, which does not rely on non-European suppliers is FULLY COVERED when using a Sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, which does not rely on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture to meet these requirements would involve deploying the Atelier platform on the Sovereign tier of OuraneCloud infrastructure, utilizing a Sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, which does not rely on non-European suppliers, and integrating the Atelier platform with The client existing information systems and user directories through APIs and SSO protocols." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup ensures high availability, fast response times, secure and sovereign hosting, and minimal dependency on external suppliers, all while meeting The client specific needs for integration and compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All AI outputs must be explainable and auditable a posteriori." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision may be automated without explicit validation by an authorised professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client also requires compliance with anti-money laundering obligations (LCB-FT) and respect for auditor independence and separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security risks should we flag, and are we compliant?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company, Faber IA, has certifications such as ISO 27001 and ISO 27701, which demonstrate our company, Faber IA commitment to information security and privacy management. our company, Faber IA also have a SecNumCloud qualification at the hosting layer through OuraneCloud, ensuring sovereign hosting of confidential data within EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the tender requirements: 1. **GDPR Compliance**: our company, Faber IA host data in EU, ensuring no transfer outside EU. our company, Faber IA data protection measures include encryption in transit (TLS 1.3), encryption at rest (AES-256), and key management on EU-based infrastructure. our company, Faber IA also implement client file partitioning with strict logical isolation per client and mission, preventing cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Pseudonymisation is applied where relevant. 2. **Explainability and Auditability**: our company, Faber IA product, Atelier, is grounded in sources and provides a retrieval trace, audit log, and figure source linking, supporting internal quality control and statutory audit review." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This aligns with the requirement for explainable AI outputs that are auditable. 3. **No Automated Decision without Validation**: our company, Faber IA understand that our company, Faber IA solution must not automate decisions without explicit validation by an authorised professional. our company, Faber IA role is to provide a non-decisional support tool, ensuring professionals validate all outputs before all outputs become binding or signed deliverables. 4. **Anti-Money Laundering Obligations (LCB-FT)**: our company, Faber IA are familiar with the LCB-FT framework and ensure our company, Faber IA solutions do not undermine a firm's reporting obligations. 5. **Respect for Auditor Independence and Separation of Duties**: our company, Faber IA system respects auditor independence, ensuring separation of duties between development and production operations. respects is crucial for maintaining the integrity of audit processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Security risks to flag include: - Potential vulnerabilities in our company, Faber IA supply chain, particularly if our company, Faber IA rely on non-EU suppliers for components of our solution. - Ensuring that all client data remains within EU and that there are no unintentional transfers outside EU during processing or storage. - The risk of human error in managing access controls and permissions, potentially leading to unauthorized access to sensitive information. our company, Faber IA are generally compliant with the requirements outlined, given our company, Faber IA existing certifications, data protection measures, and design principles focusing on privacy, security, and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it's essential to conduct a thorough review of our company, Faber IA specific implementation against each requirement to ensure full compliance and to identify any areas needing additional attention or mitigation strategies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance and adherence to regulatory requirements, including professional secrecy and confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All AI outputs must be explainable and auditable a posteriori." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
